    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Wel is eac to warnianne, ðæt man wite, ðæt hy ðurh mægsibbe to gelænge ne beon, ðe læs ðe man eft twæme, ðæt man ær awoh tosomne gedydan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is also well to take care that one knows that they are not too closely related, lest one afterwards put asunder what was previously wrongly joined together.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Wel is eac to werianne, þæt man wite, þæt hy ðurh mæigsibbe to gelænge ne beon, ðe læs ðe man eft twæme, þæt mæn ær awoh tosomne gedydon.</ab>
      </div>
